   "html": "<h2><span class=\"num\">1</span>Every ḥarf is fixed, with no place</h2>"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "t": "p",
   "chapter": 1,
   "data": {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Pronouns, pointing words and question isms are fixed, but they still have a place: rafʿ, naṣb or jarr. A ḥarf is different. It is fixed and it has no place at all."
   },
   "html": "<p class=\"s0p\">Pronouns, pointing words and question isms are fixed, but they still have a place: rafʿ, naṣb or jarr. A ḥarf is different. It is fixed and it has no place at all.</p>"
  },
