   "t": "rule",
   "chapter": 4,
   "data": {
    "t": "rule",
    "color": "olive",
    "title": "When to use بَلَى",
    "text": "Use {بَلَى} when the question has \"not\" in it and your answer is yes. \"Didn't you go?\" {بَلَى}: \"Yes, I did.\""
   },
   "html": "<div class=\"rbox\" style=\"border-color:#6b8e23;background:#edf4dc\"><b style=\"color:#4c6810\">When to use بَلَى.</b> Use <bdi class=\"ab\">بَلَى</bdi> when the question has &quot;not&quot; in it and your answer is yes. &quot;Didn&#x27;t you go?&quot; <bdi class=\"ab\">بَلَى</bdi>: &quot;Yes, I did.&quot;</div>"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "t": "tip",
   "chapter": 4,
   "data": {
    "t": "tip",
    "text": "In {أَمَا ذَهَبْتَ؟} the {مَا} is the \"did not\" ḥarf from unit 6: {مَا ذَهَبْتَ} \"you did not go\". Add the question ḥarf {أَ}: {أَ} + {مَا} + {ذَهَبْتَ} = \"Didn't you go?\""
   },
   "html": "<div class=\"tipbox\"><b>Tip:</b> In <bdi class=\"ab\">أَمَا ذَهَبْتَ؟</bdi> the <bdi class=\"ab\">مَا</bdi> is the &quot;did not&quot; ḥarf from unit 6: <bdi class=\"ab\">مَا ذَهَبْتَ</bdi> &quot;you did not go&quot;. Add the question ḥarf <bdi class=\"ab\">أَ</bdi>: <bdi class=\"ab\">أَ</bdi> + <bdi class=\"ab\">مَا</bdi> + <bdi class=\"ab\">ذَهَبْتَ</bdi> = &quot;Didn&#x27;t you go?&quot;</div>"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "t": "h2",
   "chapter": 5,
   "data": {
    "t": "h2",
    "text": "The question ḥarfs (هَلْ and أَ)"
   },
   "html": "<h2><span class=\"num\">5</span>The question ḥarfs (هَلْ and أَ)</h2>"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "t": "p",
   "chapter": 5,
   "data": {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "You met them in unit 5. They make a yes/no question. They are ḥarfs, so they have no place. The question words {مَنْ}، {مَا}، {أَيْنَ} are isms and do have a place."
   },
   "html": "<p class=\"s0p\">You met them in unit 5. They make a yes/no question. They are ḥarfs, so they have no place. The question words <bdi class=\"ab\">مَنْ</bdi>، <bdi class=\"ab\">مَا</bdi>، <bdi class=\"ab\">أَيْنَ</bdi> are isms and do have a place.</p>"
  },
