  {
   "i": 28,
   "t": "summary",
   "chapter": 7,
   "data": {
    "t": "summary",
    "title": "In short",
    "items": [
     "Every ḥarf is fixed and has no place: {لَا مَحَلَّ لَهُ مِنَ الإِعْرَابِ}.",
     "Jarr: {مِنْ} {إِلَى} {عَنْ} {عَلَى} {فِي} {بِـ} {لِـ} {كَـ} {حَتَّى}. The next noun is jarr.",
     "Joining: {وَ} {فَ} {ثُمَّ} {أَوْ} {بَلْ}. The next word copies the one before.",
     "Answer: {نَعَمْ} {لَا} {بَلَى}. {بَلَى} answers a \"not\" question.",
     "Question: {هَلْ} {أَ}. Calling: {يَا}, then one damma: {يَا مُحَمَّدُ}."
    ]
   },
   "html": "<div class=\"three\"><h3>In short</h3><ol><li>Every ḥarf is fixed and has no place: <bdi class=\"ab\">لَا مَحَلَّ لَهُ مِنَ الإِعْرَابِ</bdi>.</li><li>Jarr: <bdi class=\"ab\">مِنْ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">إِلَى</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">عَنْ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">عَلَى</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">فِي</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">بِـ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">لِـ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">كَـ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">حَتَّى</bdi>. The next noun is jarr.</li><li>Joining: <bdi class=\"ab\">وَ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">فَ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">ثُمَّ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">أَوْ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">بَلْ</bdi>. The next word copies the one before.</li><li>Answer: <bdi class=\"ab\">نَعَمْ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">لَا</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">بَلَى</bdi>. <bdi class=\"ab\">بَلَى</bdi> answers a &quot;not&quot; question.</li><li>Question: <bdi class=\"ab\">هَلْ</bdi> <bdi class=\"ab\">أَ</bdi>. Calling: <bdi class=\"ab\">يَا</bdi>, then one damma: <bdi class=\"ab\">يَا مُحَمَّدُ</bdi>.</li></ol></div>"
  }
